{"title":"Dune Marauder","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 29 Raider that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (7.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=28\" title=\"Pick level 28\"><td><b>28</b></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>4</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>30</b></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>8</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=31\" title=\"Pick level 31\"><td><b>31</b></td><td>124</td><td>21.6</td><td>1,550</td><td class=\"muted\">372 · 30.2 · 4,650</td><td>10</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-marauder\" data-map-level=\"30\">Show level 30 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 10 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-marauder\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/varra-sunstrike\"><img src=\"data/img/9bef3010fbd730cd4612.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Varra Sunstrike</b><span>Lv 31</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Raider: <a href=\"#/monster/dune-outrider\">Dune Outrider</a> <span class=\"muted\">(17)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-raider\">Dune Raider</a> <span class=\"muted\">(23)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-warlord\">Dune Warlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher\">Dune Skirmisher</a> <span class=\"muted\">(37)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-blade\">Dune Blade</a> <span class=\"muted\">(41)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-captain\">Dune Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord\">Dune Sandlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/raider-high-chief\">Raider High Chief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(55)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/9bef3010fbd730cd4612.webp\" alt=\"Dune Marauder\"></div><h3>Dune Marauder</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>30</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 29)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Raider</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>118</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>21</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><t